# Huddle — web client environment (optional)
# Copy to .env in apps/web/ to enable optional features.

# GitHub OAuth App client id — enables the "Continue with GitHub" button
# in the Sign-in modal. The server must also be configured with the matching
# GITHUB_CLIENT_ID + GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET (see apps/server/.env.example).
# Leave unset to show a "belum dikonfigurasi" toast instead of redirecting.
VITE_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=